    "created_at": "2023-09-13T08:16:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-13T08:16:43Z",
    "body": "So the pseudo-class for popover was renamed to `:popover-open` in order to differentiate it from `:open` since any element can be a popover and be open as a popover separately from a dialog, details, or select element being open.\r\n\r\nWe can and should still make `:open` and `:closed` apply to dialogs, details, and selects as tab mentioned is written in the selectors spec.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
